<h3 id="create-the-subviews">Create the Subviews</h3>

<p>First, we need to create an instance of replicatorLayer, then add one dot to it and stagger the angles. The knowledge point involved here is basically the relationship between position and bounds. I don’t want to ramble on; just google it yourself. Here’s the code:</p>

