<p>Most people use <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Masonry</code> these days, so let’s use <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Masonry</code> for auto layout here. The reason for using auto layout is that when external code uses auto layout for its views, the internal code needs to update the relevant <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">layer</code>’s <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">frame</code>. Here’s the code:</p>

